{
    "info": {
        "_postman_id": "daa187ba-c58f-4a89-abe5-6dd83357f464",
        "name": "03 - Payment Request",
        "description": "Endpoints to create and moderate plan subscription payment proofs.",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "Get Paged Payment Requests",
            "event": [
                {
                    "listen": "test",
                    "script": {
                        "exec": [
                            "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                            "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                            "});",
                            "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                            "if (jsonData && jsonData.data && jsonData.data.items && jsonData.data.items.length > 0) {",
                            "    pm.environment.set(\"paymentRequestId\", jsonData.data.items[0].id);",
                            "}"
                        ],
                        "type": "text/javascript"
                    }
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "auth": {
                    "type": "bearer",
                    "bearer": [
                        {
                            "key": "token",
                            "value": "{{user1_token}}",
                            "type": "string"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "description": "### Endpoint Overview\n\nFetches a paginated list of subscription payment requests with dynamic sorting and filtering.\n\n---\n\n### Available Domain Attributes & Filter Reference\n\n| Attribute Name | Data Type | Filter Support | Description / Allowed Values |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `Id` | `int` | Exact | Unique Identifier |\n| `PlanId` | `int` | Exact | Target subscription plan ID |\n| `PlanPriceId` | `int` | Exact | Target pricing tier ID |\n| `CouponId` | `int` | Exact | Redeemed coupon ID (Nullable) |\n| `CouponCode` | `string` | Searchable | Redeemed coupon code |\n| `OriginalAmount` | `decimal` | Between | Before discount price |\n| `DiscountAmount` | `decimal` | Between | Coupon savings amount |\n| `FinalAmount` | `decimal` | Between | Final price after discount |\n| `CurrencyCode` | `string` | Exact | ISO currency code |\n| `Status` | `Enum (int)` | Exact | `1` = Pending, `2` = Approved, `3` = Rejected |\n| `ReviewNotes` | `string` | - | Admin review notes |\n| `RejectionReason`| `string` | - | Rejection description |\n| `ReviewedBy` | `int` | Exact | Admin user ID |\n| `ReviewedAt` | `DateTime` | Between | ISO admin review date |\n| `FileUrl` | `string` | - | URL of payment receipt receipt |\n| `CreatedOn` | `DateTime` | Between | ISO creation date |\n| `CreatedById` | `int` | Exact | Requester ID |\n\n---\n\n### Filter Usage Guide (For Request Body)\n\n- **Exact Filters (`exactFilters`):** Pass attribute name with array of string/enum values. Example: `\"exactFilters\": { \"Status\": [\"1\"] }`\n- **Between Filters (`betweenFilters`):** Pass attribute name with `min` and `max`. Example: `\"betweenFilters\": { \"FinalAmount\": { \"min\": \"100\", \"max\": \"500\" } }`",
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                    {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                    }
                ],
                "body": {
                    "mode": "raw",
                    "raw": "{\n  \"pageNumber\": 1,\n  \"pageSize\": 10,\n  \"orderBy\": \"Id\",\n  \"orderDirection\": \"asc\",\n  \"filters\": {\n    \"betweenFilters\": {},\n    \"exactFilters\": {}\n  }\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                    "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/PaymentRequest",
                    "host": [
                        "{{baseUrl}}"
                    ],
                    "path": [
                        "api",
                        "PaymentRequest"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "response": []
        },
        {
            "name": "Get Payment Request By Id",
            "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                    "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/PaymentRequest/{{paymentRequestId}}",
                    "host": [
                        "{{baseUrl}}"
                    ],
                    "path": [
                        "api",
                        "PaymentRequest",
                        "{{paymentRequestId}}"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "response": []
        },
        {
            "name": "Create Payment Request",
            "event": [
                {
                    "listen": "test",
                    "script": {
                        "exec": [
                            "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                            "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                            "});",
                            "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                            "if (jsonData && jsonData.data && jsonData.data.id) {",
                            "    pm.environment.set(\"paymentRequestId\", jsonData.data.id);",
                            "}"
                        ],
                        "type": "text/javascript"
                    }
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "body": {
                    "mode": "formdata",
                    "formdata": [
                        {
                            "key": "File",
                            "type": "file",
                            "src": []
                        },
                        {
                            "key": "PlanId",
                            "value": "{{subscriptionPlanId}}",
                            "type": "text"
                        },
                        {
                            "key": "PlanPriceId",
                            "value": "{{planPriceId}}",
                            "type": "text"
                        },
                        {
                            "key": "CouponCode",
                            "value": "SUMMER50",
                            "type": "text"
                        },
                        {
                            "key": "IsPublic",
                            "value": "false",
                            "type": "text",
                            "disabled": true
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "url": {
                    "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/PaymentRequest/Create",
                    "host": [
                        "{{baseUrl}}"
                    ],
                    "path": [
                        "api",
                        "PaymentRequest",
                        "Create"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "response": []
        },
        {
            "name": "Approve Payment Request",
            "request": {
                "auth": {
                    "type": "bearer",
                    "bearer": [
                        {
                            "key": "token",
                            "value": "{{user1_token}}",
                            "type": "string"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "method": "PUT",
                "header": [
                    {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                    }
                ],
                "body": {
                    "mode": "raw",
                    "raw": "{\n  \"reviewNotes\": \"Valid payment proof verified.\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                    "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/PaymentRequest/Approve/{{paymentRequestId}}",
                    "host": [
                        "{{baseUrl}}"
                    ],
                    "path": [
                        "api",
                        "PaymentRequest",
                        "Approve",
                        "{{paymentRequestId}}"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "response": []
        },
        {
            "name": "Reject Payment Request",
            "request": {
                "auth": {
                    "type": "bearer",
                    "bearer": [
                        {
                            "key": "token",
                            "value": "{{user1_token}}",
                            "type": "string"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "method": "PUT",
                "header": [
                    {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                    }
                ],
                "body": {
                    "mode": "raw",
                    "raw": "{\n  \"rejectionReason\": \"Proof image is blurry or incorrect.\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                    "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/PaymentRequest/Reject/{{paymentRequestId}}",
                    "host": [
                        "{{baseUrl}}"
                    ],
                    "path": [
                        "api",
                        "PaymentRequest",
                        "Reject",
                        "{{paymentRequestId}}"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "response": []
        }
    ],
    "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [
            {
                "key": "token",
                "value": "{{user1_token}}",
                "type": "string"
            }
        ]
    }
}